{"full":"hf:Param20h/PDF-Assit_RAG","spaceId":"Param20h/PDF-Assit_RAG","name":"Document AI Analyst","source":"huggingface","description":"Enterprise Agentic RAG — upload PDFs and chat with AI","category":"AI & machine learning","language":null,"topics":["docker","region:us"],"technologies":[],"likes":3,"created":"2026-02-26T09:43:48.000Z","updated":"2026-08-19T05:22:37.000Z","license":"mit","runtime":"RUNNING","appUrl":"https://param20h-pdf-assit-rag.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Param20h/PDF-Assit_RAG","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T17:56:14.292Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T17:56:14.292Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T17:56:14.292Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"🧠","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Upload · Embed · Retrieve · Chat — A production-grade AI document assistant built end-to-end with an agentic RAG pipeline, streaming responses, and per-user data isolation.","PDF-Assistant-RAG is a complete, production-ready AI document assistant that lets users upload complex PDFs, financial reports, legal contracts, and research papers — then chat with an AI that provides accurate, cited answers powered by a multi-stage Retrieval-Augmented Generation pipeline.","The system uses hybrid search (vector + BM25) with Reciprocal Rank Fusion and cross-encoder reranking to find the most relevant document chunks, streams AI-generated answers token-by-token, and highlights exact source citations with page numbers — all inside a modern Next.js frontend with JWT-secured per-user data isolation."],"features":["🤖 Discord Bot Integration","⚡ Celery + Redis Background PDF Processing","📧 Email Verification Workflow","🧠 RAGAS Evaluation Pipeline","🚀 Response Caching with Redis"],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Param20h/PDF-Assit_RAG/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"6ffea057c7f5c5df145a4fb43845a1035cc1d71bd75dd35b56f43c2e522984f1","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T17:24:40.100Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"202